/* Main menu cave backdrop: Art/UI/MainMenuBackdrop.png, the menu art's final look baked into
   one opaque 640x360 picture — Art/scene/Background L1BG_ Layer4, 3, 2, 1, then
   Art/scene/Frontground/foreground7 on top, blended in sRGB like the reference shot. Baked
   rather than stacked at runtime: the project renders in linear space, where the layers'
   faint teal washes (alpha 56) would blend to a different tone than the reference.

   Pixel art, point filtered and uncompressed in its import settings: at the 1920x1080 reference
   it shows at exactly 3x. It covers the screen centred on any aspect ratio. The colour behind it
   is the frame's ink, for the instant before the art is up. */

.backdrop {
    background-color: rgb(39, 43, 75);
    background-image: url("project://database/Assets/Art/UI/MainMenuBackdrop.png?fileID=2800000&guid=b6396c7d3340468b8f5f1abd546ffcee&type=3#MainMenuBackdrop");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
}
